nd to scourge, and to crucify him: and the third day he shall rise again.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["shall deliver",["G3860"]],["him",["G846"]],["to the Gentiles",["G1484"]],["to",["G1519"]],["mock,",["G1702"]],["and",["G2532"]],["to scourge,",["G3146"]],["and",["G2532"]],["to crucify",["G4717"]],["him: and",["G2532"]],["the third",["G5154"]],["day",["G2250"]],["he shall rise again.",[]]]},{"verse":20,"text":"Then came to him the mother of Zebedee’s children with her sons, worshipping him, and desiring a certain thing of him.","words":[["Then",["G5119"]],["came",["G4334"]],["to him",["G846"]],["the mother",["G3384"]],["of Zebedee’s children",["G5207"]],["with",["G3326"]],["her",["G846"]],["sons,",["G5207"]],["worshipping",["G4352"]],["him, and",["G2532"]],["desiring",["G154"]],["a certain",["G5100"]],["thing",["G3844"]],["of him.",[]]]},{"verse":21,"text":"And he said unto her, What wilt thou? She saith unto him, Grant that these my two sons may sit, the one on thy right hand, and the other on the left, in thy kingdom.","words":[["And",["G1161"]],["he said",["G2036"]],["unto her,",["G846"]],["What",["G5101"]],["wilt thou?",["G2309"]],["She saith",["G3004"]],["unto him,",["G846"]],["Grant",["G2036"]],["that",["G2443"]],["these",["G3778"]],["my",["G3450"]],["two",["G1417"]],["sons",["G5207"]],["may sit,",["G2523"]],["the one",["G1520"]],["on",["G1537"]],["thy",["G4675"]],["right hand,",["G1188"]],["and",["G2532"]],["the other",["G1520"]],["on",["G1537"]],["the left,",["G2176"]],["in",["G1722"]],["thy",["G4675"]],["kingdom.",[]]]},{"verse":22,"text":"But Jesus answered and said, Ye know not what ye ask. Are ye able to drink of the cup that I shall drink of, and to be baptized with the baptism that I am baptized with? They say unto him, We are able.","words":[["But",["G1161"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["answered",["G611"]],["and said,",["G2036"]],["Ye know",["G1492"]],["not",["G3756"]],["what",["G5101"]],["ye ask.",["G154"]],["Are ye able",["G1410"]],["to drink",["G4095"]],["of the cup",["G4221"]],["that",["G3739"]],["I",["G1473"]],["shall",["G3195"]],["drink of,",["G4095"]],["and",["G2532"]],["to be baptized",["G907"]],["with the baptism",["G908"]],["that",["G3739"]],["I",["G1473"]],["am baptized with?",["G907"]],["They say",["G3004"]],["unto him,",["G846"]],["We are able.",[]]]},{"verse":23,"text":"And he saith unto them, Ye shall drink indeed of my cup, and be baptized with the baptism that I am baptized with: but to sit on my right hand, and on my left, is not mine to give, but it shall be given to them for whom it is prepared of my Father.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["he saith",["G3004"]],["unto them,",["G846"]],["Ye shall drink",["G4095"]],["indeed",["G3303"]],["of my",["G3450"]],["cup,",["G4221"]],["and",["G2532"]],["be baptized",["G907"]],["with the baptism",["G908"]],["that",["G3739"]],["I",["G1473"]],["am baptized with:",["G907"]],["but",["G1161"]],["to sit",["G2523"]],["on",["G1537"]],["my",["G3450"]],["right hand,",["G1188"]],["and",["G2532"]],["on",["G1537"]],["my",["G3450"]],["left,",["G2176"]],["is",["G2076"]],["not",["G3756"]],["mine",["G1699"]],["to give,",["G1325"]],["but",["G235"]],["it shall be given to them for whom",["G3739"]],["it is prepared",["G2090"]],["of",["G5259"]],["my",["G3450"]],["Father.",[]]]},{"verse":24,"text":"And when the ten heard it, they were moved with indignation against the two brethren.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["when the ten",["G1176"]],["heard",["G191"]],["it, they were moved with indignation",["G23"]],["against",["G4012"]],["the two",["G1417"]],["brethren.",[]]]},{"verse":25,"text":"But Jesus called them unto him, and said, Ye know that the princes of the Gentiles exercise dominion over them, and they that are great exercise authority upon them.","words":[["But",["G1161"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["called",["G4341"]],["them",["G846"]],["unto him, and said,",["G2036"]],["Ye know",["G1492"]],["that",["G3754"]],["the princes",["G758"]],["of the Gentiles",["G1484"]],["exercise dominion over",["G2634"]],["them,",["G846"]],["and",["G2532"]],["they that are great",["G3173"]],["exercise authority upon",["G2715"]],["them.",[]]]},{"verse":26,"text":"But it shall not be so among you: but whosoever will be great among you, let him be your minister;","words":[["But",["G1161"]],["it shall",["G2071"]],["not",["G3756"]],["be",["G2071"]],["so",["G3779"]],["among",["G1722"]],["you:",["G5213"]],["but",["G235"]],["whosoever",["G3739","G1437"]],["will",["G2309"]],["be",["G1096"]],["great",["G3173"]],["among",["G1722"]],["you,",["G5213"]],["let him be",["G2077"]],["your",["G5216"]],["minister;",[]]]},{"verse":27,"text":"And whosoever will be chief among you, let him be your servant:","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["whosoever",["G3739","G1437"]],["will",["G2309"]],["be",["G1511"]],["chief",["G4413"]],["among",["G1722"]],["you,",["G5213"]],["let him be",["G2077"]],["your",["G5216"]],["servant:",[]]]},{"verse":28,"text":"Even as the Son of man came not to be ministered unto, but to minister, and to give his life a ransom for many.","words":[["Even as",["G5618"]],["the Son",["G5207"]],["of man",["G444"]],["came",["G2064"]],["not",["G3756"]],["to be ministered unto,",["G1247"]],["but",["G235"]],["to minister,",["G1247"]],["and",["G2532"]],["to give",["G1325"]],["his",["G846"]],["life",["G5590"]],["a ransom",["G3083"]],["for",["G473"]],["many.",[]]]},{"verse":29,"text":"And as they departed from Jericho, a great multitude followed him.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["as they",["G846"]],["departed",["G1607"]],["from",["G575"]],["Jericho,",["G2410"]],["a great",["G4183"]],["multitude",["G3793"]],["followed",["G190"]],["him.",[]]]},{"verse":30,"text":"And, behold, two blind men sitting by the way side, when they heard that Jesus passed by, cried out, saying, Have mercy on us, O Lord, thou Son of David.","words":[["And,",["G2532"]],["behold,",["G2400"]],["two",["G1417"]],["blind men",["G5185"]],["sitting",["G2521"]],["by the way",["G3598"]],["side,",["G3844"]],["when they heard",["G191"]],["that",["G3754"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["passed by,",["G3855"]],["cried out,",["G2896"]],["saying,",["G3004"]],["Have mercy",["G1653"]],["on us,",["G2248"]],["O Lord,",["G2962"]],["thou Son",["G5207"]],["of David.",[]]]},{"verse":31,"text":"And the multitude rebuked them, because they should hold their peace: but they cried the more, saying, Have mercy on us, O Lord, thou Son of David.","words":[["And",["G1161"]],["the multitude",["G3793"]],["rebuked",["G2008"]],["them,",["G846"]],["because",["G2443"]],["they should hold their peace:",["G4623"]],["but",["G1161"]],["they cried",["G2896"]],["the more,",["G3185"]],["saying,",["G3004"]],["Have mercy",["G1653"]],["on us,",["G2248"]],["O Lord,",["G2962"]],["thou Son",["G5207"]],["of David.",[]]]},{"verse":32,"text":"And Jesus stood still, and called them, and said, What will ye that I shall do unto you?","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["stood still,",["G2476"]],["and called",["G5455"]],["them,",["G846"]],["and",["G2532"]],["said,",["G2036"]],["What",["G5101"]],["will ye",["G2309"]],["that I shall do",["G4160"]],["unto you?",[]]]},{"verse":33,"text":"They say unto him, Lord, that our eyes may be opened.","words":[["They say",["G3004"]],["unto him,",["G846"]],["Lord,",["G2962"]],["that",["G2443"]],["our",["G2257"]],["eyes",["G3788"]],["may be opened.",[]]]},{"verse":34,"text":"So Jesus had compassion on them, and touched their eyes: and immediately their eyes received sight, and they followed him.","words":[["So",["G1161"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["had compassion",["G4697"]],["on them, and touched",["G680"]],["their",["G846"]],["eyes:",["G3788"]],["and",["G2532"]],["immediately",["G2112"]],["their",["G846"]],["eyes",["G3788"]],["received sight,",["G308"]],["and",["G2532"]],["they followed",["G190"]],["him.",[]]]}]}